00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.970
and then I'm going to analyze,

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:59.593
how does gang competition
matter for extortion?

00:02:59.593 --> 00:03:02.470
Does it matter whether
they are competing or not

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:05.040
for territory, for extortion rates,

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.790
and what are the downstream effects

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.293
