00:03:46.499 --> 00:03:48.880
The second thing that
we're going to explore

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.500
to try to answer the question about

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.500
how does gang competition
matter for extortion,

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.440
