00:41:37.840 --> 00:41:40.080
We didn't find any change of those,

00:41:40.080 --> 00:41:44.140
whether the number of deliveries,
the number of retailers,

00:41:44.140 --> 00:41:46.620
even the cost of the goods didn't change.

00:41:46.620 --> 00:41:48.609
So we were surprised about
this because we thought that,

00:41:48.609 --> 00:41:51.790
so we went back to the
pyramid and we asked like,

00:41:51.790 --> 00:41:52.623
look, we're seeing,

00:41:52.623 --> 00:41:55.770
and there were like, well,
we cannot change that much.

00:41:55.770 --> 00:41:57.680
What they mention is that
they don't have that margin

00:41:57.680 --> 00:41:58.647
to change that because first,

00:41:58.647 --> 00:42:03.460
they are the exclusive distribution
